        {
          "text": "Mavinda mavĩtu yĩla Saulo waĩ mũsumbĩ waitũ, nue watongoesye Isilaeli kũmaumaalasyaa na kũmatũngaa: na Yeova akwĩa, Nue ũkethĩwa mũĩthi wa andũ makwa Isilaeli, na ũkethĩwa mũnene wĩ mbee ũsumbĩnĩ wa Isilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
