              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na yĩla Ndaviti wakũlilye Yeova, amwĩa, Ndũkambate: melingĩle ĩtina woo, noimavithũkĩa welekele mĩtĩnĩ ya mĩvolosati. ",
